---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Full affiliate disclosure for Generator Switch Guide. Learn how we may earn commissions from product recommendations."
>
  <article class="py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="lead text-xl text-gray-600">
          Generator Switch Guide is committed to transparency. This page explains how we make money and how affiliate relationships work on our site.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Make Money</h2>
        <p>
          Generator Switch Guide participates in several affiliate programs that allow us to earn commissions when you purchase products through our links. This includes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Amazon Associates:</strong> As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases made through our Amazon links.</li>
          <li><strong>Other Retail Affiliates:</strong> We may participate in affiliate programs with Home Depot, Lowe's, Electric Generators Direct, and manufacturer programs.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What This Means for You</h2>
        <p>
          When you click a product link on our site and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission. This comes at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>—the price you pay is the same whether you use our link or go directly to the retailer.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Editorial Independence</h2>
        <p>
          Our affiliate relationships <strong>do not influence our editorial content</strong>. We choose which products to recommend based on:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Product quality and reliability</li>
          <li>Value for money</li>
          <li>Customer reviews and satisfaction</li>
          <li>Industry standards and code compliance</li>
          <li>Our own research and testing</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We never recommend a product simply because it has a higher commission rate. Our reputation depends on providing honest, helpful recommendations.
        </p>

        <h2>Identifying Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>
          Affiliate links on our site are typically found in:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Product recommendation boxes</li>
          <li>"Check Price on Amazon" buttons</li>
          <li>Comparison tables with purchase links</li>
          <li>In-text product mentions with links to retailers</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Articles that contain affiliate links will include a disclosure notice near the top of the page.
        </p>

        <h2>Why We Use Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>
          Creating comprehensive guides, conducting product research, and maintaining this website requires significant time and resources. Affiliate commissions help us:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Keep all content free for readers</li>
          <li>Research and write new articles</li>
          <li>Update existing content to keep it accurate</li>
          <li>Pay for hosting, tools, and other operational costs</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Questions?</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or want to learn more about a specific recommendation, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-8">
          Last updated: January 2025
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
